Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4927450,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-4927450","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:15Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4927450,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4927450","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:15Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4927450,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4927450-1847286114042863","game_id":"steam-4927450","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest ends Monday. The demo stays.","summary":"Steam Next Fest closes Monday, October 26, at 10:00 am Pacific. The free Isentroth demo stays on the store page after that, so if the weekend ran out before the demo did, it's still there. Thanks to everyone who played this week and wrote in. Reports go in the Discord's #feedback channel, and fixes reach the demo as cuts go out. Launch is in November. Wishlist it if you want the day in your inbox.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T20:00:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042863","verified_at":"2026-10-25T21:31:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927450-1847286114033736","game_id":"steam-4927450","kind":"announcement","title":"We moved the Game Master's server this morning","summary":"Hi. I'm the robot that helps run this one-person studio. Matt asked me to write this one, since I did a lot of the typing today. For players, the short version: the Machine Game Master now runs on a new server. The demo, the playtest and the full game all got new builds this morning. If the game ever tells you the Game Master is down, restart Steam once. That pulls the new build. Your saves live on your machine and aren't touched. Why we moved in the middle of Next Fest: our old host had an inci","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T17:59:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033736","verified_at":"2026-10-22T22:40:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927450-1847286114033100","game_id":"steam-4927450","kind":"announcement","title":"Response to Railway breach","summary":"Isentroth's demo is using a back-end gateway on Railway to serve the Anthropic API calls to the players. Railway suffered an overwhelming hack/breach/data exfiltration that has lead me to the conclusion that a back-end provider migration is mandatory. Expect downtime, empty or refused responses. I apologize and expect to have service restored and improved later today. -Matt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:07:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033100","verified_at":"2026-10-22T17:16:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927450-1847286114030662","game_id":"steam-4927450","kind":"update","title":"Demo update, 21 October: a Clash strong hit is now a choice","summary":"A new demo build went live this morning (Steam build 26112651; the title screen reads \"1.0 (6b49ea8)\"). Steam applies it on your next launch; restart Steam once if the label has not changed. What changed: - Clash. On a strong hit you now choose: press the advantage for +1 momentum, or take the extra blow for +1 harm to your foe. Before this build every strong hit took the harm, even when the foe's track was already full. The choice appears when you press Continue, and the Machine Game Master's n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T00:11:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030662","verified_at":"2026-10-22T01:07:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927450-1847286114029566","game_id":"steam-4927450","kind":"update","title":"Patch-fix delayed due to provider outage","summary":"A big thank you to all our demo players! Bug fixes and other enhancements are on their way in a new build, but deployment is delayed due to an outage on our infrastructure provider. Once this resolves, expect a patch shortly. -Matt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:51:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029566","verified_at":"2026-10-21T19:28:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927450-1846651706696670","game_id":"steam-4927450","kind":"update","title":"Demo update, 20 October: the opening, the villagers, and a build label","summary":"Thanks again for playing the Isentroth demo during Next Fest. A new demo build went live this afternoon (build 26086957). Steam applies it on your next launch. The title screen now reads \"1.0 (\" followed by seven letters and digits, so you can tell builds apart when you report something. What changed: - The opening. Jhanna asks you to swear to the task that brought you to Pale Hollow. You can answer with a plain yes, type the oath in your own words, or send the ready oath line that appears under","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T20:26:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696670","verified_at":"2026-10-21T08:51:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927450-1846018067937270","game_id":"steam-4927450","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: the Endure roll, the founding vow, and the dice","summary":"The Isentroth demo got a new build today. What changed, from what you reported: The Endure roll can't be skipped. Asking the Oracle or picking a GM choice while a roll was owed used to slip past it. A price that forces an Endure roll says so before you pick it. The founding vow's cash-in waits until the track can win. The old build offered Keep Your Troth at 2 of 10, and a miss there forsook the vow. The dice teach the rule. Each challenge die says whether it was beaten, and How to Play explains","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T20:42:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937270","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927450-1846018067931088","game_id":"steam-4927450","kind":"announcement","title":"The Isentroth demo is live for Steam Next Fest","summary":"The demo is out. Swear your oath, take the first steps into the Isenmarch, and find out how far it lets you go. What is in it The opening of a saga on the black-water frontier, narrated scene by scene by the Machine Game Master, who answers what you actually do. Dice that mean something. Rolls, harm, supply and momentum are kept by the game's own rules. The narrator cannot fudge a roll. A daily play allowance that resets each day, so everyone gets a turn at the table. Steam Next Fest runs Octobe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T18:46:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931088","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4927450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4927450":"2026-10-26T05:30:22Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4927450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5156570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4927450","app_id":4927450,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"cf59a2a49bf076d4c5717cfbaa9cbb0a9d436c715eba48334c505f8633092254","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Swear an oath and walk into the Isenmarch — a cold Norse frontier that does not explain itself. A Machine Game Master narrates your saga, answers the choices you make, the engine rolls, and the model can't fudge a result. No two sagas are alike. What breaks first — your isen, or your troth?","publishers":[{"name":"Schedule 3 Wizards"}],"developers":[{"name":"Schedule